  },
  "locked": true,
  "problems": [],
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "B01",
      "duration": 9.725,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B01.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c10536a1a28349ff95f71d183d1abdaff29a5a3c61848e1a191ed7ec1c9a7f29",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "10,000 people, with homes, schools, a clinic, parks, and streets to walk along.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.15
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "And not one of them is standing on land.",
          "start": 6.55,
          "end": 9.725
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B02",
      "duration": 11.975,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B02.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "72141890e74fb6cc7fef194e8451e918b42c3a32fdf57e00dd48b2b2f0ad1c08",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Could we design a city like this, one that floats, stays where we put it, and keeps working?",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.45
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Let's treat it as a design problem, and solve it one step at a time.",
          "start": 6.85,
          "end": 11.975
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B03",
      "duration": 31.275,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B03.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "3bde1e407917f349a98c4491e72e979da8ef753a346944c7ff4649024e59997a",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Floating neighborhoods are not science fiction.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.175
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "In Amsterdam, a floating neighborhood called Schoonschip is home to 46 households, a little over 100 people.",
          "start": 3.575,
          "end": 12.6
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Much larger designs exist on paper.",
          "start": 13.0,
          "end": 16.375
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "One, for 12,000 people off the coast of Busan in South Korea, was unveiled in 2022,",
          "start": 16.775,
          "end": 24.25
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "and when we checked in November 2026, its architects still listed it as in design.",
          "start": 24.65,
          "end": 31.275
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B04",
      "duration": 6.225,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B04.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "36d7741ab4a80666fb0277a32741f4310bbdedaedf910f2e1414930fef4b5e5e",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "So let's take our city apart,",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.425
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "and build it back, one problem at a time.",
          "start": 2.825,
          "end": 6.225
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B05",
      "duration": 19.575,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B05.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4a276c220ad7e65c2740868fafab49617b4923a31dcc8f0191f1c3d5a026df40",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Problem one: how does something this heavy float at all?",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.9
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Take a block of concrete.",
          "start": 4.3,
          "end": 6.65
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "As a solid lump, it sinks: concrete is more than twice as dense as seawater.",
          "start": 7.05,
          "end": 12.9
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "Shape the same concrete into a hollow box, 40 meters on each side, and it floats.",
          "start": 13.3,
          "end": 19.575
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B06",
      "duration": 13.95,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B06.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2d1ce3e81753daff695f96572cfd2b7b527a401be610cbd7bfc002fd2226d989",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "It floats because it pushes water out of the way, and the water it pushes aside weighs as much as the platform.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 7.625
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Every ton we add needs roughly one more cubic meter of water pushed aside.",
          "start": 8.025,
          "end": 13.95
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B07",
      "duration": 22.175,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B07.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2f1059886c18ed800ea182c242fafc2bf54afcef0ab45aeeb89754018626cf23",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Real floating homes work exactly this way.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.525
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "The Schoonschip houses stand on concrete floats.",
          "start": 3.925,
          "end": 7.475
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "The heaviest weighs around 340 to 350 metric tons,",
          "start": 7.875,
          "end": 13.75
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "so it pushes aside roughly as many cubic meters of canal water: a cube about 7 meters on each side.",
          "start": 14.15,
          "end": 22.175
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B08",
      "duration": 19.625,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B08.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "af53878ebcaf70ef4d0cfde6b245f28f4b8c0b79df5c2075564e60d0324c2064",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Our first platform, in this illustrative design, carries four blocks of three-story homes.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.35
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Altogether it weighs about 4,800 tons, and floats about 3 meters deep.",
          "start": 6.75,
          "end": 13.45
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "And here's the surprise: more than half of that weight is the concrete hull itself.",
          "start": 13.85,
          "end": 19.625
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B09",
      "duration": 14.325,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B09.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "3cff3c80329d08a035446762698066cd8cd428d1b23a931349de14451b6b670e",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Now add a fourth story.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.225
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "The platform settles about a third of a meter deeper,",
          "start": 2.625,
          "end": 6.625
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "and the freeboard, the part of the hull above the water, shrinks from about a meter to about 70 centimeters.",
          "start": 7.025,
          "end": 14.325
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B10",
      "duration": 18.1,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B10.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c938e32803342040271dfcc06b41fc2e7f1f78087e82b3b665c2e588b9d96eec",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "One fix is to make the hull half a meter deeper.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.05
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "That adds about 100 tons of concrete, 4% more,",
          "start": 4.45,
          "end": 9.425
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "and brings the freeboard back to about a meter and 15 centimeters.",
          "start": 9.825,
          "end": 14.775
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "Lighter buildings would be another way.",
          "start": 15.175,
          "end": 18.1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B11",
      "duration": 20.5,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B11.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "85450827d5f09015558e86b0382b7da94501c387612850c5f587876cedd48c4b",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Will it tip over?",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 1.9
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Move 100 tons out toward the edge, and in this example the platform tilts by less than half a degree.",
          "start": 2.3,
          "end": 9.9
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "But a small tilt under a shifted load tells us very little about how it will move in waves.",
          "start": 10.3,
          "end": 17.025
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "Floating is only the first problem.",
          "start": 17.425,
          "end": 20.5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B12",
      "duration": 14.175,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B12.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "8ad96d1efb7d259455a9d9f2e56d0aba3cb51024a78b2421c001c5f79030b4bb",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Let's go back to the three-story version. A platform like this holds about 50 people.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.225
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "For 10,000, we need a lot of them.",
          "start": 6.625,
          "end": 9.675
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "So why not simply join them all into one enormous slab?",
          "start": 10.075,
          "end": 14.175
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B13",
      "duration": 29.575,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B13.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b13b12663d0a4911b264c36a42099ef13a86322a86cdd43c76702d1d789c7e1d",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Look at two identical platforms carrying different buildings, one with two stories and one with four.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 7.05
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Floating on their own, their decks would sit about 66 centimeters apart in height.",
          "start": 7.45,
          "end": 13.4
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "So different loads add a demand on whatever connects them.",
          "start": 13.8,
          "end": 18.225
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "In this design, the walkways between platforms are hinged, so they can follow the difference.",
          "start": 18.625,
          "end": 25.1
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "Adding ballast to even out the decks would be another option.",
          "start": 25.5,
          "end": 29.575
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B14",
      "duration": 26.125,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B14.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "122c9a84e81320d178584823115c81a76fa31c655af8cc9a9987638b6715370c",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Connections are where engineers expect trouble.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.475
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "A 2026 research agenda lists stress concentrations on connectors among the challenges of large floating developments.",
          "start": 3.875,
          "end": 13.125
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "One concept study links its modules flexibly, and spaces them far enough apart not to collide, because on flexible moorings they are expected to move sideways quite a lot.",
          "start": 13.525,
          "end": 26.125
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B15",
      "duration": 24.05,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B15.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b5cb35fd579bd4243a346358a3507d2075c21cc4772af69ed078fb7bf0abb81f",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "How many platforms would 10,000 people need?",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.675
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Say each resident needs about 40 square meters of floor: thirty for their home, and ten for a share of schools, shops and services.",
          "start": 4.075,
          "end": 13.55
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "That's about thirty-three hectares of platform:",
          "start": 13.95,
          "end": 17.375
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "about 200 platforms like our first one, with hundreds of connections between them.",
          "start": 17.775,
          "end": 24.05
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B16",
      "duration": 32.75,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B16.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e8a45421cbdc07f284a525b1a4e302b515a1f4cc6f3ff37ea0869637c8101311",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Bigger platforms mean fewer connections.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.275
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "At 100 meters on a side, 34 would do,",
          "start": 3.675,
          "end": 8.0
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "but each would weigh about 30,000 tons, to build, launch and tow.",
          "start": 8.4,
          "end": 13.675
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "Even the Schoonschip floats were too big for the dry docks of traditional houseboat builders, and were cast on the quay instead.",
          "start": 14.075,
          "end": 22.325
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "text": "Our district uses 60-meter platforms with three-story homes, 93 of them: a middle choice for this illustration, not an optimum.",
          "start": 22.725,
          "end": 32.75
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B17",
      "duration": 10.875,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B17.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "5bec6b5cc7bf152dc56b3924ad14e1958a162d845621dc481e256d50fbb30a98",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "And all of this sits on water that never keeps still.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.8
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Each platform rises and falls on its own, and every gap and hinge between them has to cope.",
          "start": 4.2,
          "end": 10.875
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B18",
      "duration": 14.475,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B18.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7216ca3ae43595c36247aa1da96d6f37ceb6b82a6ee181da6f63ecf768ad82b9",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "People living on the water feel it.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.75
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Floating homes in the Netherlands can rock in storms, or when large cruise ships pass,",
          "start": 3.15,
          "end": 9.225
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "and one Amsterdam resident feels it most on her upper floor.",
          "start": 9.625,
          "end": 14.475
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B19",
      "duration": 9.2,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B19.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "f7a667e51d66ed37b3dfebff259354cf1417ee6d33c700732d3208b2644cabd0",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Very large platforms don't only move. They bend,",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.25
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "and predicting exactly how is still an open research problem.",
          "start": 4.65,
          "end": 9.2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B20",
      "duration": 20.475,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B20.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "dde2b01e6c1ed1dcaebc0ffff1c51f91883501e74c337b7e91779db63477819a",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "So the first fix is where you build.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.925
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "A 2026 concept study looks for sea areas with limited fetch, near a gulf, a strait or an archipelago, where waves stay moderate.",
          "start": 3.325,
          "end": 13.75
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "That's why our city sits in a sheltered bay, connected to an existing city on shore.",
          "start": 14.15,
          "end": 20.475
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B21",
      "duration": 28.125,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B21.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "1f961025726f8d3739a4861201e737638f2b95f4211cbe1af89a3833eadfe228",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "The second fix is the layout.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.625
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Following one concept study, homes go in the middle, and functions that can tolerate more motion form the outer ring.",
          "start": 3.025,
          "end": 11.425
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Where the bay opens to the sea, a breakwater reduces the waves.",
          "start": 11.825,
          "end": 16.8
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "But a floating breakwater may not be enough against longer waves from the open sea, and how much wave energy passes behind one is still hard to predict.",
          "start": 17.2,
          "end": 28.125
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B22",
      "duration": 10.175,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B22.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "41a2707d737e51b772a6caef1d34041d61adf8bb274ac1fb4122479fc4550ea2",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Something also has to hold the city in place.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.525
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Floating homes in the Netherlands are fixed to the shore, often resting against steel poles.",
          "start": 3.925,
          "end": 10.175
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B23",
      "duration": 24.125,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B23.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2a4c340dd5965b64f5c5d7535bb71b67856b35771896d1507ae8d4c1c34ad87a",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Water levels rise and fall, and a floating platform rises and falls with them, sliding along its poles.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 7.85
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "In our scenario, the water level can change by about 2 meters,",
          "start": 8.25,
          "end": 13.075
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "so the bridges to shore need hinges: including changes in loading, the slope of a 25-meter bridge changes by about 3 degrees either way.",
          "start": 13.475,
          "end": 24.125
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B24",
      "duration": 16.1,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B24.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "92a009c4f7684c6f1a4983562accc09f81e3d3fc792bd8a82e4da6d85b14d490",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Further out, the water is deeper, and piles give way to mooring lines anchored in the seabed.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.45
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Deeper water means longer lines, deeper anchors, and higher costs.",
          "start": 6.85,
          "end": 12.025
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "The seabed itself shapes the design, and the bill.",
          "start": 12.425,
          "end": 16.1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B25",
      "duration": 8.7,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B25.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "1d551232e91ffad36d9822ebacecd6b45e93a1a38dbe2fe52da1d0007679f795",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "So it floats, and it stays put. But is it a city yet?",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.075
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Fade out the buildings, and the city's other half appears.",
          "start": 4.475,
          "end": 8.7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B26",
      "duration": 16.075,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B26.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2e1dbce525291c2b18d3394ce5be9c1b1d37c8f9d89496a8bb9a1cc0d415d163",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Power first: at Schoonschip, 46 households share a single connection to the national grid,",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.95
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "with solar panels, a battery in every house, and a smart grid between them.",
          "start": 7.35,
          "end": 13.05
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Floating doesn't mean off-grid.",
          "start": 13.45,
          "end": 16.075
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B27",
      "duration": 24.125,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B27.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "64c916ffaf71a18c92064b52f0108fbbfec533e25cff5cf231c43b1bcc07bc66",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Wastewater is separated there too: gray water from showers and washing machines, black water from toilets.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 7.925
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Connecting floating homes to sewers on land takes extra infrastructure, such as waterproof cables and pumps.",
          "start": 8.325,
          "end": 16.275
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "In our city, wastewater is pumped ashore along the bridges, and drinking water comes back the same way.",
          "start": 16.675,
          "end": 24.125
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B28",
      "duration": 17.175,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B28.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "4c2491b4bb35b46b7cd14aa225d478eaf105e04b928643aae8246282d6085e44",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Transport, fire and medical services, and food all follow the same logic.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 5.85
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "A large floating development has to connect sewage, power and roads to land, or develop alternatives of its own,",
          "start": 6.25,
          "end": 14.675
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "and our city connects.",
          "start": 15.075,
          "end": 17.175
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B29",
      "duration": 8.05,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B29.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "0fa6aacbb6152ae98e6b7838bd4a840d217f4da9235eaec0cf716ddf36da6b19",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Everything so far assumed sheltered water close to a city.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.6
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "So what happens if we tow it out to sea?",
          "start": 5.0,
          "end": 8.05
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B30",
      "duration": 12.725,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B30.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c379b92c89b72cd90ed31307f3ed6ecf70bb540f98009cc4495d55e30dfac054",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Longer waves arrive, and a floating breakwater may not be enough against them.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 5.575
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Below the surface, the seabed drops away, so mooring lines get longer and anchors deeper.",
          "start": 5.975,
          "end": 12.725
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B31",
      "duration": 9.65,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B31.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "526994ac70d3918eb7901d19b90481ede7d8ffe3636f01f71a5c0861c9601b81",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Further from shore, cables, pipes and supply ships can still reach the city,",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 5.6
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "but every link becomes longer and more exposed.",
          "start": 6.0,
          "end": 9.65
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B32",
      "duration": 19.45,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B32.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "d2da363eefa46540ba6a510d6f8cc0f881b1c7ee7fab26179106431995ed3039",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "And if we also asked the city to supply itself, as one 2026 offshore concept does,",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 7.475
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "it would need its own systems for energy, water and food.",
          "start": 7.875,
          "end": 12.3
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "In that study, growing food alone accounts for nearly half of the city's estimated energy use.",
          "start": 12.7,
          "end": 19.45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B33",
      "duration": 17.525,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B33.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "fa448883f884a8e477376fbd64b094e1445fcd628b90ba78c5433ed53eb5cac2",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "That study also uses a different kind of hull:",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.775
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "semi-submersible platforms, with the deck raised above the sea on columns, behind a floating barrier.",
          "start": 4.175,
          "end": 11.775
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Offshore isn't the same city moved further out. It's a different design.",
          "start": 12.175,
          "end": 17.525
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B34",
      "duration": 17.375,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B34.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "2cdfff44dc64c81c234b7dddf296448976e8d5a14c1a8de2f2d3b979d56a8f98",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Some difficulties remain wherever we build.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.55
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Concrete in seawater needs watching: chlorides can corrode the steel reinforcement,",
          "start": 3.95,
          "end": 10.0
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "and, according to a 2026 study, there are no dedicated standards for floating cities yet.",
          "start": 10.4,
          "end": 17.375
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B35",
      "duration": 15.95,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B35.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "8a366a672762c92dbc5d96d9a2baff73a7caa04ca314c9746d3dd75eb4fa91fc",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Large floating developments change the light, shade and water movement beneath them, effects that researchers say still need study,",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 8.825
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "and they expect the impact on local ecology to be far larger than that of small developments.",
          "start": 9.225,
          "end": 15.95
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B36",
      "duration": 15.05,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B36.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "36ef7b2bdd6fceedd3bbc75ca6a70acb03a360db4d53c4dac1ba76973d9ba4d4",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "And who gets to use the water?",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.5
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "How districts like this fit into planning law is not yet known,",
          "start": 2.9,
          "end": 7.7
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "and researchers warn they could end up serving the wealthy, and fencing off water that used to be public.",
          "start": 8.1,
          "end": 15.05
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B37",
      "duration": 26.725,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B37.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "efcc204c65b0f1ba681a7aeb24f66b89f5ff2874079409872e6c4a2e67f6d9fe",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "And what would it cost?",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 1.975
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "We do not yet have a reliable cost estimate for this design. The one published framework we found is preliminary, and covers only flotation and energy.",
          "start": 2.375,
          "end": 13.325
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "Compared with land, floating structures can follow the water level, and can be moved or reused,",
          "start": 13.725,
          "end": 20.55
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "but they trade a fixed foundation for moorings, connections and ongoing maintenance.",
          "start": 20.95,
          "end": 26.725
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B38",
      "duration": 6.425,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B38.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c08ffcb937606aa918fca097ef59a17a3280b3cf9f080aa688cfbb6459aececb",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "From one platform to a district, every part we added answers a question we had to ask.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 6.425
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B39",
      "duration": 10.15,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B39.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "e97a8583c5e4f85f716805f5ef2f5da40838fb569ea0480a93199085bce13688",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "So, could we build an entire city that floats?",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 3.425
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Small floating neighborhoods, connected to the shore in sheltered water, already exist.",
          "start": 3.825,
          "end": 10.15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B40",
      "duration": 23.3,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B40.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "b9f7331adb0b5730556adb3cfad81a9bc62e90686d02a58417a43b9171335e9c",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "A connected district for 10,000 people, in a sheltered bay, built step by step, may be possible under the right conditions.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 9.05
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "But how very large platforms bend, how their connections hold up, and what they would cost are still open questions.",
          "start": 9.45,
          "end": 17.425
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "And the one project of that size we checked is still listed as in design.",
          "start": 17.825,
          "end": 23.3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B41",
      "duration": 7.425,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B41.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "bead7740159a43d681a401805951547f2a00ba0e62f372ecd9b3f8ab8219c744",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "A city far out at sea, especially one that has to supply itself, remains much more speculative.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 7.425
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B42",
      "duration": 10.65,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B42.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "791d4dbdc207610850d324a7a01251e90d7198765fba7ae0b8d824957b1e78d5",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Our arithmetic shows what it takes for a platform to float.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 4.125
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Whether a whole district works depends on the site, and on every other system we added.",
          "start": 4.525,
          "end": 10.65
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B43",
      "duration": 10.8,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B43.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "7914239ef03677a253081eec0cab91016bbc81406d0bf9483474d2501720b6f0",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Which structure should we explain next?",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.875
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "Suggest a topic in the comments.",
          "start": 3.275,
          "end": 6.1
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "And if you enjoyed this film, please like it and subscribe.",
          "start": 6.5,
          "end": 10.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "B44",
      "duration": 5.7,
      "audio_file": "audio/beats/B44.wav",
      "audio_sha256": "c8d499a72ceda04b098a6c5e4c9b65029165c07701be6709a2a6ce32898b10f5",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "Thank you for watching.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.075
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "The sources are listed in the description.",
          "start": 2.475,
          "end": 5.7
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
